{"title":"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/e/bbea845ae525c09563fc253c515753423c50962b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(z) = i\\overline{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/9/75952e52a3dc061d24146c0df9062a54a5ce5a5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i=\\sqrt{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b8023032c1d94aa923383802ca03df3b4315df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{z}$\" width=\"9\" height=\"11\" /> is the complex conjugate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. How many values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> satisfy both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/7/ac79adbf9c00c9d3488c9cf9b2f0ee9510de9676.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|z| = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"55\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/4/9f43355c31544cdd37ec99251612acb0a7dc9ff9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(z) = z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/e/a8eb5f691ed381ffacd39e4cb130e6db75b30e2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 1 \\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 2  \\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 4 \\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"344\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/f/d5fdcd6e4bbde5f0a3289c503472267ec35d37e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = a+bi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/a/3fad1c419964ceed35955d9af14dd0dc0307271a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{z} = a-bi$\" width=\"79\" height=\"12\" />. By definition, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/4/814037a724bc0963079ba5e0e6b24b209fa9cfe1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = a+bi = f(z) = i(a-bi) = b+ai$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"297\" height=\"18\" />, which implies that all solutions to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/4/9f43355c31544cdd37ec99251612acb0a7dc9ff9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(z) = z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> lie on the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/1/741a74d86df899c10724dc2f80638f5e7f599194.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /> on the complex plane. The graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/7/ac79adbf9c00c9d3488c9cf9b2f0ee9510de9676.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|z| = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"55\" height=\"20\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Circle\" title=\"Circle\">circle</a> centered at the origin, and there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/3/8535ab671e44b3ef949b43df5639a2670b46ad01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" /> intersections.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/b/46b245331cc3cccf7ccaf7e2f6a34fa2131b8b33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=a+bi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" />, like above. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/f/5ef5ea4d936cdff3e1c619a31516734497c3c830.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = a+bi = i\\overline{z} = i(a-bi) = ai+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"280\" height=\"18\" />. We move some terms around to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/4/82428359dd579e006476a5b9fcf5142df2cec8bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bi-b = ai-a$\" width=\"116\" height=\"12\" />. We factor: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/b/12b8963f553c911721a6ed3b6000dfca0173b4d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(i-1) = a(i-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" />. We divide out the common factor to see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/2510c0ee8fa65393d9a6689e806595cd57234ea2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = a$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />. Next we put this into the definition of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/e/43e129f9bd77867d1af2074fd87c28b404cf46a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|z| = a^2 + b^2 = a^2 + a^2 = 2a^2 = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"271\" height=\"19\" />. Finally, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/8/728e77a1880a69b47b398ae495da1fb742f36865.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{25}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"88\" height=\"43\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> has two solutions.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Via trig, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/4/614bf0ef1f982aa247e1a9a47c6096b018623fdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=r(\\cos(x)+i\\sin(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"185\" height=\"20\" />. Since we wish for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/b/5cb5b51cc87e6a5d8b13da9b7276b114f07c6647.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|z|=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"55\" height=\"20\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/c/8cc63d5667f0a88fc3d53c6d20c92b5be6dd5595.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=5$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />. We want to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/0/9e0b0edfc0e16383fc83b7b8cbb6757c9a34c4d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\in [0, 2\\pi)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"84\" height=\"20\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/8/39867106d6a06b53cbb5cd07fee886291a928da8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(z)=i\\overline{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"76\" height=\"20\" />. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/a/40a9e67fdffa7ae3110b8a1c5f0c1cbc01faa42f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{z}=5(\\cos(x)-i\\sin(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"186\" height=\"20\" />, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/c/5ac70bfd76a793f8c0447c8aed32f0f41459af65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i\\overline{z}=5(i\\cos(x)+\\sin(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"192\" height=\"20\" />. Thus, we have: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/b/5eb30c82201795ee9fb42a8c08a9f122132aae5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5(\\cos(x)+i\\sin(x))=5(i\\cos(x)+\\sin(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"327\" height=\"20\" />. Grouping the real and imaginary values, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/f/caf5be4083d323d2ee6d72a984a32b03ac477e96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos(x)=\\sin(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"122\" height=\"20\" />. Note that this has two solutions in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/1/5212cf082a56e5bfd4ec65534477c18d650b46a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[0, 2\\pi)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" />. Thus, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> valid solutions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B\">2004 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017200334\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 279/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6423/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.715      1 -total\n 59.91%    7.617      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 38.39%    4.882      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6387:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017200334 and revision id 273463. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}